C: oh a ninja | ninja loot accusation in faction, here we go
B: i'm not a ninja. i'm just fast at clicking | i'm not a ninja. i just have a quick mouse
D: {name_b} what was the rare | what dropped
B: a ring. a nice ring. not even that nice | just a ring. kind of plain
A: "not even that nice". it was the best ring in the zone | plain?? that ring sells for more than your whole outfit
E: if its so plain {name_b}, give it to {name_a} | then hand it over {name_b}, if its so plain
B: cant. i'm wearing it | too late, its on my finger already
A: you're WEARING it?? | you put it ON??
F: lol the ring is on | ninja and wearing the evidence
B: i wanted to see how it looked. it looks good | it matches my boots
