B: and you're a sore loser with slow hands {name_a} | and you're slow, {name_a}. slow hands, slow brain
G: ohhh | burn
A: i have the combat log. every line | i saved the log. you'll see
B: show it then | lets see the log, detective
H: a ninja loot with evidence. this is going to be good | someone call a judge
C: ninja week in faction lol | ring drama. my favorite kind of drama
~ 6
